# Keep the build context small and free of local state. Without this file,
# `COPY . .` in the builder stage copies the host's node_modules (with native
# binaries for the wrong platform/libc) over the freshly installed ones, and
# local .env files with secrets end up in the build.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
changes.bundle
.claude
.codex
